    "commissioned_thesis": "A defining tension of the current moment lies in the collision between breathless, AI-assisted claims of epochal discovery and the austere discipline of formal verification. When rushed announcements purport to settle foundational questions in number theory\u2014such as the Riemann hypothesis\u2014they operate less like settled canon and more like modern apocrypha: seductive, hastily circulated manuscripts whose authority dissolves the instant seasoned rigor is brought to bear. The pulse of the day is not mere skepticism, but a sharpened discernment separating computational eloquence from enduring truth.",
